ex:X1 a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Bitcoin mainnet transactions and real fees"@en ; backlog:hasExclusionRationale "the course project runs on signet; the proof works the same way and needs no real money" .
ex:X2 a backlog:ScopeExclusion ; rdfs:label "Proving who originally wrote a note"@en ; backlog:hasExclusionRationale "a timestamp proves that a file existed and who registered it at that time; it cannot show that the registrant did not copy it from an unregistered source" .
